        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hotdog Cart Simulator</strong> is a co-op cooking and business sim where you and up to 5 friends run your very own hotdog cart.<br><br>Start small on the sidewalk, grilling sausages, assembling buns, and hustling to serve hungry customers. Customize every dog to their exact liking. It might be ketchup, mustard, or  pickles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024270/extras/728e0f5e5efb5f1f2821fdc88631e132.poster.avif?t=1762315500\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024270/extras/728e0f5e5efb5f1f2821fdc88631e132.webm?t=1762315500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024270/extras/728e0f5e5efb5f1f2821fdc88631e132.mp4?t=1762315500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don’t think it’s that easy. Supplies don’t fetch themselves, you’ll need to <strong>catch your meat</strong> (literally), restock buns, and keep your stand from falling apart. Work together, or watch chaos unfold when your crew gets… distracted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024270/extras/f8279bb61b26d26b0c5b007b886c0740.avif?t=1762315500\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your hard-earned cash, buy upgrades for your cart, unlock new ingredients, and eventually trade in your rickety setup for your very own<strong> hotdog shop</strong>.<br><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌭 Play solo or up to 6-player co-op hotdog-slinging chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌭 Fully customize the hotdogs to match customer demands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌭 “Catch your meat” and resource runs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌭 Earn money to unlock upgrades, ingredients, and equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌭 Expand from a street cart to your own customizable hotdog shop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌭 A balance of strategy, teamwork, and ridiculous fun</p>",
