h\" >🌭 “Catch your meat” and resource runs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌭 Earn money to unlock upgrades, ingredients, and equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌭 Expand from a street cart to your own customizable hotdog shop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌭 A balance of strategy, teamwork, and ridiculous fun</p>",
